+- `ModelContainer` is `Sendable` and thread-safe.
+- `ChatSession` is not thread-safe; use one session per task/flow.
+- `MLXArray` is not `Sendable`; keep it inside one isolation domain or use `SendableBox` transfer patterns.
 
