++commit 4bce0423c42f7f6c859b21b2e666145660c60a1d
++Author: Federico Marmori <fmarmori@gmail.com>
++Date:   Tue Jan 27 00:50:08 2026 +0100
++
++    Support for NemotronH (#75)
++    
++    * feat: add nemotron_h model support
++    
++    Port nemotron_h model architecture from Python mlx-lm to Swift mlx-swift-lm.
++    This enables running NVIDIA-Nemotron-3-Nano-30B-A3B and similar models.
++    
++    Components added:
++    - NemotronHConfiguration: Model config struct
++    - NemotronHMamba2Mixer: SSM block using ssmUpdate
++    - NemotronHAttention: GQA attention with RoPE
++    - NemotronHMLP: Simple MLP with relu2 activation
++    - NemotronHMoE: MoE with sigmoid gating and shared experts
++    - NemotronHBlock: Pattern-based routing (M/*/E)
++    - NemotronHModel: Main model with hybrid cache support
++    
++    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
++    
++    * fix: proper NemotronH implementation matching Python naming
++    
++    - Use 'backbone' key for inner model (matches Python Model.backbone)
++    - Use 'mixer' key for all block types (matches Python DecoderLayer.mixer)
++    - Add NemotronHMixer protocol for unified interface
++    - Add LoRAModel conformance
++    - Sanitize handles conv1d axis swap and expert stacking
++    
++    * fix: correct Python mismatches in NemotronH implementation
++    
++    * feat: add memberwise initializer for NemotronHConfiguration and implement unit tests
++    
++    * fix: use separate module keys for each mixer type in NemotronHBlock
++    
++    * fix: use single mixer property for polymorphic blocks
++    
++    * test: add comprehensive configuration decoding tests for NemotronH
++    
++    * doc: add NemotronH to the list of currently supported model types in README
++    
++    * fix: correct indentation for NemotronH model registration in LLMTypeRegistry
