+++++    
+++++    * Fix compiler warnings
+++++    * Deprecate SuScaledRotaryEmbedding
+++++    * Fix defaultHubApi shared mutable state warning
+++++    * Fix non-final class warnings
+++++    * Fix ModelAdapterFactory warnings
+++++    * Resolve concurrency warnings in registries
+++++    * Make handler in Tool sendable
+++++    * Fix Message type ambiguity
+++++    * Replace `[String: Any]` with `[String: any Sendable]`
+++++    * Use real tests for streamlined API
+++++    
+++++    * Refactor streamlined API
+++++    
+++++    * Rename files with ChatSession for clarity
+++++    
+++++    * Pin swift-transformers until next release
+++++    
+++++    * Make additionalContext sendable
+++++    
+++++    * Make tool schema sendable
+++++    
+++++    * ChatSession: use AsyncStream-based generate instead of deprecated callback
+++++    
+++++    * `sending` adjustments
+++++    
+++++    * Docstring fix
+++++    
+++++    * Mark non-thread-safe methods as deprecated, add thread-safe methods to ModelContainer
+++++    
+++++    * Format
+++++
