++++++
++++++    /// Produces a streaming response to a prompt.
++++++    ///
++++++    /// - Parameters:
++++++    ///   - prompt: the user prompt
++++++    ///   - images: list of images (for use with VLMs)
++++++    ///   - videos: list of videos (for use with VLMs)
